(slower-hummingbird-sv05-landing-6dof)
*title Hummingbird six-DOF descent to landing altitude checkpoint
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle aero-load-mode=direct-wrench aero-wrench-frame=source-z-up rotor-allocation=quad-x rotor-arm-m=0.17 rotor-thrust-coefficient=5.57e-6 rotor-reaction-torque-coefficient=1.36e-7 rotor-speed-min=0 rotor-speed-max=1500 reference-area=1.0 reference-length=0.34 dry-mass-kg=0.5 inertia-x=0.00365 inertia-y=0.00368 inertia-z=0.00703 envelope-max-speed=10 ground-contact-mode=settle ground-contact-segment=2 ground-contact-restitution=0.0 ground-contact-friction=static ground-contact-damping-per-s=8.0 rotor-force-model=individual-rotor-source rotor-drag-xy-coefficient=0.000119 rotor-drag-z-coefficient=0.000232 rotor-translational-lift-coefficient=0.00339 rotor-frame-drag-x-coefficient=0.005 rotor-frame-drag-y-coefficient=0.005 rotor-frame-drag-z-coefficient=0.01 aero-source-quality=source-derived
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0 longitude-deg=0 altitude-m=0
*runtime status route mode=great-circle start-latitude-deg=0 start-longitude-deg=0 duration-s=13 powered-end-s=13 powered-speed-mps=0.2 powered-climb-rate-mps=0.0 position-capture-gain=0.1
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=0.0 attitude-gain=0.005 rate-damping=0.005 max-sideslip-deg=20 max-pitch-deg=3 rotorcraft-waypoint-gain-mps2-per-m=1.0 rotorcraft-velocity-damping-per-s=1.5 rotorcraft-altitude-gain-mps2-per-m=1.5 rotorcraft-altitude-damping-per-s=2.0 rotorcraft-attitude-gain-nm-per-rad=0.05 rotorcraft-rate-damping-nm-s-per-rad=0.01 rotorcraft-collective-gain-rad-s-per-mps2=20
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=1 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=720 motor-shutdown-time-s=9.0 motor-shutdown-time-s=9
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime control rotor-speed vehicle=1 default=468.7244338633868 lower=0 upper=1500
*trajectory 1 hummingbird start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378139.179764251 y=2.602053780224289e-12 z=1.99148608186061e-09 xdt=-0.00394610175736443 ydt=-2.160325228113369e-12 zdt=-1.650371764459454e-09 qw=0.7071067811626126 qx=5.750874739225958e-13 qy=-0.7071067812104825 qz=-5.132306812358406e-13 time=0 mass=0.5 propellant_mass=0
*segment 1 landing
    *integ dtprnt=0.05 dt=0.001
    *fly propnav=4
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *when time>13 stop
  *segment 2 contact-settle
    *integ dtprnt=0.05 dt=0.001
    *when time>15.0 stop
*end
